seline":{"text":"有时，强风会带动松林摇摆，\n同时掀起海潮的声响。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「呐，只有这个哦」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-1fc","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1fc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我将印刷着白石建筑公司字样的浴巾递给了她。\n那是我们曾经用来擦身的东西。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-296","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-296"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2c6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2c6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「别那么失望嘛」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-31f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-31f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…嗯」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-344","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-344"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她有些不满地接过了浴巾。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-37f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-37f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我根本就没办法去给她找泳装。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-3c2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3c2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"何况，她居然在这个季节，这个地方，提出想要比基尼。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-40f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-40f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我没有办法，只好在车里翻找了一通，\n最终从那堆衣物里找出了这白色的浴巾。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-491","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-491"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"片刻之后…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-4bc","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4bc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她穿着心爱的裙子，\n将浴巾卷在胸前回来了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-552","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-552"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…怎么样？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-580","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-580"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「呃，该怎么说呢…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-5dd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5dd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「看上去…不奇怪吧？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-611","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-611"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯…大概没问题吧」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-662","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-662"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「………………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-694","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-694"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，一点问题也没有，一点也不奇怪的」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-701","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-701"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，知道了…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-72c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-72c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她慢慢地走向了大海。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-785","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-785"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"海浪拍打着沙滩。\n长发在冰冷的海风中飘动着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-7d7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7d7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从空中飘下的点点雪花，\n更增添了几分寒意。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-84d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-84d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这样一幅背景下，她双手拿着鞋子…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-88c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-88c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"喜悦地，兴奋地，\n在水中漫步着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-918","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-918"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「呐…有模特的感觉吗？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-956","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-956"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，还可以吧…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-987","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-987"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在寒冬的空气中，我们的气息化作了白雾。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-9c8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9c8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"之后，\n我掏出了从车里带出的照相机。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-a24","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a24"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…是那台简陋的一次性相机。\n里边还剩下最后的１张胶卷。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-a91","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a91"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那我就准备拍了」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-ae7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ae7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哎…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-b13","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b13"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「一定…会拍出更多模特的感觉来的」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-b50","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b50"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说着，我举起了相机。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-bb1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-bb1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-be1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-be1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「来，大方一点」","spe