ci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2229"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"强风将浪头变作飞沫，\n拍打在她的身上。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-229f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-229f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"慢慢地，她转过身来…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2315","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2315"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…是啊…谁知道呢」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2382","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2382"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊哈哈，我自己也不知道呢」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-23cb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-23cb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说着，她对着我，最后又微笑了一次。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2424","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2424"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"尽管冰冷的飞沫拍打在她的身上，尽管眼中含满了泪水，\n但她仍然对着我微笑了一次。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-24a6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24a6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从前，在浪边停下的脚步…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-24fb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24fb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这一次，却再也没有停下来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2546","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2546"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…所以，我想，这就是她的回答吧…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-25f6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-25f6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那么…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-265e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-265e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"再见…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-26df","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-26df"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…就这样，我们９６０ｋｍ的旅途结束了…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2738","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2738"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"对我来说是１５天，\n对她来说则是２２年的旅途结束了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-27b2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-27b2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她以自己的意志逃出了７楼与家的选择。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2807","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2807"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"成为了２００５年度推算自杀者人数３万５千人中的一位。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2864","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2864"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她的血型是Ｏ型，名字叫濑津美，２２岁，女性…\n塑料识别手环的颜色是白色。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-28e0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-28e0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这就是属于她的一切。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2947","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2947"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…但是，我知道。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-29b8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-29b8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她其实很喜欢比基尼，比导航系统更加熟悉道路，\n喜欢车辆，甚至拥有自己的驾照。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2a4e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2a4e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"尽管总是面无表情，也很少会看我一眼，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2aa3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2aa3"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但偶尔，也会露出那种好似害羞又好似倔强的神色…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2b0a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2b0a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在翡翠色的大海前…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2b4d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2b4d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她会兴奋地，喜悦地，宛如偶像明星一般地对着我微笑…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2bd3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2bd3"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"遗憾的是…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2c08","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2c08"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她的笑容。\n却仅仅被记录在了一张由一次性相机拍摄的照片中。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2cb8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2cb8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…但是…尽管是仅存的一张照片…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08\",\"main\"]/mjo-2d05","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar1_08","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2d05"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……它也是我们所留下的痕迹……","speaker":"旁白"}}]}
